Package: tceqcrp
Title: Scripted Downloads from the TCEQ CRP Water Quality Portal
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Schramm", email = "mps9506@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Programmatic access to the Texas Commission on Environmental
    Quality (TCEQ) Clean Rivers Program (CRP) public data portal. Handles
    JSF session state, basin/station selection, and download of
    tab-delimited water quality data files.
